<title>HUNGARY: Hungary May jobless rate 10.6 pct vs Apr 10.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary May jobless rate 10.6 pct vs Apr 10.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's unemployment rate fell to 10.6 percent in May from 10.8 percent in April, the Labour Ministry said in a statement. The unemployment rate in May 1996 was 10.7 percent.</p>
<p>  HUNGARY JOBLESS	   May 1997    April 1997   May 1996</p>
<p>  registered unemployed   471,821     482,000	490,000</p>
<p>  rate (pct)		   10.6	  10.8	   10.7</p>
<p>NOTE - All percentaga figures are based on the size of active population in January 1996.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
